  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Academy for Gender Justice</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to establish a Gender Justice Academy in Armenia to enhance the capacity of professionals in addressing gender-based violence. Through intensive training, knowledge exchange, and collaboration, it seeks to strengthen the response to violence against women and girls, improve victim support services, and empower survivors. By leveraging partnerships, survivor-centered approaches, and sustainable strategies, the project aims to create lasting change and contribute to safer communities for all.</narrative>
  </description>
